<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1834949969"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1891331027"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="哀温ノ詩"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="指出毬亜"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Just Believe!!!"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:01.044"><div begin="00:14.759" end="04:01.444"><p begin="00:14.759" end="00:20.892" itunes:key="L12150">堪えた涙　流したいなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若不忍叹息凝噎</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ra e ta na mi da na ga shi ta i na ra</span></p><p begin="00:20.902" end="00:27.508" itunes:key="L12151">溺れるくらい 流しきればいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">便放任泪水横溢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o bo re ru ku ra i na ga shi ki re ba i i</span></p><p begin="00:27.806" end="00:33.888" itunes:key="L12152">いつか今日を 思い出したら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">惟愿将来重忆今日</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka kyo u wo o mo i da shi ta ra</span></p><p begin="00:33.909" end="00:40.342" itunes:key="L12153">誰かに優しくただ なれればいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可为你增添几许温柔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re ka ni ya sa shi ku ta da na re re ba i i</span></p><p begin="00:40.352" end="00:46.557" itunes:key="L12154">千歳(ちとせ)越え 輝く愛を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱逾千年 明明不灭</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi to se ko e ka ga ya ku a i wo</span></p><p begin="00:46.894" end="00:56.537" itunes:key="L12155">千里(ちさと)越え 思い こめるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">念逾万里 重重如山</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi sa to ko e o mo i ko me ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:56.547" end="01:03.066" itunes:key="L12156">佗びし度 奏で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">孤寂独奏此一曲</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa bi shi ta bi ka na de</span></p><p begin="01:03.086" end="01:09.323" itunes:key="L12157">包み込みましょう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以旋律予以拥抱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu tsu mi ko mi ma sho u</span></p><p begin="01:09.604" end="01:16.038" itunes:key="L12158">温もりを 伝え<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怀脉脉温情 无私传递</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">nu ku mo ri wo tsu ta e</span></p><p begin="01:16.048" end="01:26.671" itunes:key="L12159">誰より傍で 唄ってゆこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">咫尺相伴 远歌不歇</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re yo ri so ba de u ta 't te yu ko u</span></p><p begin="01:29.406" end="01:35.495" itunes:key="L12160">独り過ごす 月夜(つくよ)の日には<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">孤月当空 照茕孑一人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to ri su go su tsu ku yo no hi ni wa</span></p><p begin="01:35.505" end="01:41.949" itunes:key="L12161">求めるままに ここに来ればいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心若有所求 尽管前来此处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo to me ru ma ma ni ko ko ni ku re ba i i</span></p><p begin="01:41.959" end="01:48.490" itunes:key="L12162">空蝉(うつせみ)に出逢えた奇跡<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尘世相逢如奇迹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u tsu se mi ni de a e ta ki se ki</span></p><p begin="01:48.501" end="01:58.187" itunes:key="L12163">慈(いつく)しみ抱いて 繋ぐから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">慈悲为怀 爱终将相连</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ku shi mi da i te tsu na gu ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:58.197" end="02:04.690" itunes:key="L12164">陽だまりの如き<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一如旭日暖阳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi da ma ri no go to ki</span></p><p begin="02:04.702" end="02:10.848" itunes:key="L12165">夢をみせましょう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彰显绚烂梦境</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me wo mi se ma sho u</span></p><p begin="02:11.204" end="02:17.632" itunes:key="L12166">温もりを 与え<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怀脉脉温情 敬心奉献</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">nu ku mo ri wo a ta e</span></p><p begin="02:17.642" end="02:28.495" itunes:key="L12167">其の こころへと 唄ってゆこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唱向心间 余韵悠远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ko ko ro he to u ta 't te yu ko u</span></p><p begin="02:37.503" end="02:43.938" itunes:key="L12168">もしあなたの心この詩で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若这小小诗篇</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo shi a na ta no ko ko ro ko no u ta de</span></p><p begin="02:43.948" end="02:50.287" itunes:key="L12169">救えているのならば<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能予你几分救赎</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ku e te i ru no na ra ba</span></p><p begin="02:50.554" end="02:56.710" itunes:key="L12170">同じように誰かの痛みも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿有朝一日</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o na ji yo u ni da re ka no i ta mi mo</span></p><p begin="02:57.001" end="03:04.187" itunes:key="L12171">いつか導いて欲しい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">同样可指引他人走出伤痛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka mi chi bi i te ho shi i</span></p><p begin="03:06.301" end="03:12.797" itunes:key="L12172">佗びし度 奏で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">孤寂独奏此一曲</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa bi shi ta bi ka na de</span></p><p begin="03:12.807" end="03:19.273" itunes:key="L12173">包み込みましょう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以旋律予以拥抱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu tsu mi ko mi ma sho u</span></p><p begin="03:19.283" end="03:25.733" itunes:key="L12174">温もりを 伝え<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怀脉脉温情 无私传递</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">nu ku mo ri wo tsu ta e</span></p><p begin="03:25.743" end="03:32.248" itunes:key="L12175">誰より傍で 嗚呼<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">咫尺相伴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re yo ri so ba de a a</span></p><p begin="03:32.258" end="03:38.717" itunes:key="L12176">陽だまりの如き<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一如旭日暖阳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi da ma ri no go to ki</span></p><p begin="03:38.750" end="03:45.190" itunes:key="L12177">夢をみせましょう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彰显绚烂梦境</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me wo mi se ma sho u</span></p><p begin="03:45.200" end="03:51.687" itunes:key="L12178">温もりを 与え<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怀脉脉温情 敬心奉献</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">nu ku mo ri wo a ta e</span></p><p begin="03:51.692" end="04:01.444" itunes:key="L12179">其の こころへと 唄ってゆこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唱向心间 余韵悠远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ko ko ro he to u ta 't te yu ko u</span></p></div></body></tt>